research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md:1966:[L5] Local boundedness: there are a real $\delta_0 > 0$ and a real $K \ge 0$ with $|f(x)| \le K$ for every $x \in A$ satisfying $0 < |x - c| < \delta_0$ ([[lem-limit-implies-local-boundedness]]).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1967-
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1968-[L6] Sign preservation: if $M \ne 0$ there is a real $\delta_s > 0$ with $|g(x)| > |M|/2 > 0$ for every $x \in A$ satisfying $0 < |x - c| < \delta_s$, and $c$ is a limit point of $A_0$ ([[lem-sign-preservation-near-a-limit]]).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1969-
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1970-[L7] Restriction: if $B \subseteq A$ has $c$ as a limit point and $\lim_{x \to c} f(x) = L$, then $\lim_{x \to c} f|_B(x) = L$ (claim 2 of [[lem-limit-is-local]]).
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1971-
research/audit/wave7-dispatch/audit-refuter-ex-x-times-psi-tends-to-zero.prompt.md-1972-[L8] Neighbourhoods ([[def-neighbourhood-r]]).
